    description: "Per ADR-0028 Phase 4 additive. Once Phase 3 producer migration lands per-cluster, mark each migrated endpoint_shape value with an x-deprecated annotation in docs/schema.json. Values stay valid in the (open) schema for the deprecation window. SCHEMA_VERSION minor bump per per-cluster ship. Phase 1 (PR #3549 / commit 711e273d1) shipped the open-enum posture (no closed enum to deprecate FROM); the x-deprecated annotation is purely informational until Phase 4b removes the value from EVIDENCE_TYPES. Predecessors: at least one Phase 3 cluster's awaits_bakeoff_validation tag must clear. Tag: analysis_quality."  # 63a7
